*chippy* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

ChipLang interpreter and toolchain

*Usage:*

  ''chippy''                          Start the REPL
  ''chippy <program>''                Run a program

  ''chippy -r "code"''                Execute code directly
  ''chippy --run "code"''             Execute code directly

  ''chippy -v''                       Show version information
  ''chippy --version''                Show version information

  ''chippy -h''                       Show this help message
  ''chippy --help''                   Show this help message

*Commands:*

  ''chippy doc [topic]''              View documentation
  ''chippy doc list''                 List all documentation topics

  ''chippy doc <file.chpdoc>''        Render chpdoc to terminal

  ''chippy doc <file>''               List symbols in source file
  ''chippy doc <file> <signature>''   Show symbol documentation
  ''chippy doc <file> all''           Show all symbol documentation

  ''chippy combine [config]''         Bundle a project
  ''chippy combine new''              Create a new combine.chp file

  ''chippy check <files...>''         Check files for errors
  ''chippy check all [dir]''          Check ''.chp'' and ''.chh'' files recursively
